
% Bailando

a: vi | IV | I | V |
a_cad: vi | IV | I | V | R |
PostCh: vi | IV | I | V | R |
In: $a $a_cad
DCh: $a $a_cad
bridge: $a $a_cad
Vr: $a*2
Ch: $a*2
b: ii | IV | vi | V |
b_cad: ii | IV | vi | V | IV |
PCh: $b $b_cad
ending_cadence: ii |
outro: $a $ending_cadence
S: [G] $In $Vr $PCh $Ch $DCh $PostCh $Vr $PCh $Ch $DCh $bridge $outro
